1
00:00:00,320 --> 00:00:22,520
Welcome to Renegade Immortal, this donghua is an adaptation of the eponymous web novel written by Er Gen. \NIn these subtitles, I will assume the viewer doesn't have any prior knowledge of the genre of cultivation. Please read the attached README and always check for notes at the end of the episodes.\NThank you for watching Bonobosubs, I hope you will enjoy this awesome show !

2
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:33,920
Thousands of years ago,

3
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:33,920
the Heaven Defying Bead, an ancient artifact

4
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:33,920
fell into the cultivation world.

5
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:39,040
The strongest individual in the country of Suzaku, Situ Nan, obtained it.

6
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:43,880
The rumor is that

7
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:43,880
the Heaven Defying Bead is the key to the Ancient Celestial Realm.

8
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:50,680
Since then,

9
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:50,680
the battle for this artifact never stopped.

10
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:55,680
Four Symbols Mountain\NPlanet Suzaku

11
00:00:57,960 --> 00:01:00,280
Heaven Defying Bead

12
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:01,280
The bead is mine !

13
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:26,790
Situ, the Heaven Defying Bead is not something you can hold.

14
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:28,190
Shut up.

15
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:30,120
Situ Nan\NSecond generation Suzaku\NPeak Ascendant

16
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:31,750
If you can have it

17
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:33,990
then why can't I ?

18
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,430
How presumptuous...

19
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:17,000
To think I, the strongest individual on planet Suzaku,

20
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:19,320
the second generation Suzaku,

21
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:22,880
would be strong enough to need outsiders to join hands in defeating me.

22
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:25,630
This life was worth it !

23
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:34,150
Hand over the Heaven Defying Bead and I'll spare your life.

24
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:38,870
And if I... refuse !?

25
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:28,070
Now die !

26
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:51,910
The Death Finger ?

27
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:14,240
As time goes on,

28
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:14,910
The Heaven Defying Bead !

29
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:16,200
fate will turn in my favor.

30
00:04:16,520 --> 00:04:19,120
Accept your fate and stay mortal

31
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:21,680
or defy it to become immortal !

32
00:04:48,720 --> 00:05:05,720
Note: This is an ancient confucian text.

33
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:52,600
When the heavens are about bestow a great responsibility on a man,

34
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:54,640
they first test his resolve,

35
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:56,280
exhaust his body,

36
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:57,800
starve him,

37
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,600
empty his being,

38
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,520
and thwart all his efforts.

39
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:03,440
Wang Lin\NWang Family

40
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:03,840
Only by cultivating patience and perseverance

41
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:05,720
can one overcome everything.

42
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:06,920
Wang Lin's house\NWang Family Village

43
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:14,240
Zhou Yingsu\NWang Lin's mother

44
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:17,840
Wang Tianshui\NWang Lin's father

45
00:05:16,280 --> 00:05:19,880
Note: Tie Zhu is Wang Lin's nickname.

46
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,880
Tie Zhu,

47
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:24,590
the village has to gift wood carvings of Immortals

48
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:27,350
at the Immortal Assembly in 3 days.

49
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:30,960
This is a once-in-three-years opportunity

50
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:34,400
to influence the protection the Immortals provide to our country of Zhao.

51
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:36,080
They must have

52
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:38,240
outstanding form and spirit.

53
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:42,230
Dear, Tie Zhu,

54
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,080
lunch is ready.

55
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:46,080
Okay, you can start without me.

56
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,440
Wang Family members

57
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:55,880
You again !

58
00:05:57,000 --> 00:06:01,240
Second Brother, have you been keeping up with the interest this month ?

59
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,470
Let's check over there.

60
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:04,630
What kind of junk is this ?

61
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:07,880
This much is barely acceptable...

62
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:11,200
We will pay back everything we owe.

63
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:13,760
But this money was saved up for Tie Zhu's imperial exam.

64
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:14,830
Shut up and move !

65
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:15,630
It's our family's lifeline,

66
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:16,310
you can't take it !

67
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:17,230
Get lost !

68
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:19,150
Debts must be paid.

69
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:21,080
If you can't even repay your family

70
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:22,480
then what future do you have ?

71
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,840
You can take whatever you want from us,

72
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:26,790
but this money is my son's future !

73
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:29,630
I'm begging you !

74
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:31,650
Father, Mother,

75
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:32,650
get up !

76
00:06:32,880 --> 00:06:35,280
You won't earn your son a future by kneeling !

77
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:36,270
Oh...

78
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:38,470
At least Tie Zhu understands.

79
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:41,710
You'd better get ready for next month.

80
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:42,630
Let's go !

81
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:53,030
Sigh...

82
00:06:53,880 --> 00:06:55,760
How could the Wang Family

83
00:06:56,120 --> 00:07:00,160
not tolerate me, their second bastard son ?

84
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:02,190
Debts must be paid,

85
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:03,510
they're right...

86
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:06,270
But who should I turn to

87
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:11,830
in order to clear my debts ?

88
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,430
Tie Zhu,

89
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,870
you can probably take

90
00:07:17,760 --> 00:07:19,350
next year's imperial exam.

91
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:23,510
We've failed you...

92
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,520
Let's prepare for another year,

93
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:33,440
it's fine.

94
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,630
Tie Zhu has grown up !

95
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:38,160
Fourth Uncle !

96
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:39,040
Wang Tiantu\NWang Lin's Fourth Uncle

97
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:41,670
Fourth Brother, you came !

98
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:41,680
Brother, sit down.

99
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:46,160
I came as fast as I could,

100
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:47,470
but I was too late !

101
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:50,160
These people are getting more outrageous !

102
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:54,030
I came today

103
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:55,550
for something important.

104
00:07:56,880 --> 00:07:59,480
The Heng Yue Sect, a major Immortal sect in Zhao

105
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,750
is recruiting disciples.

106
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:03,950
They have given

107
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:06,070
3 spots to our Wang Family.

108
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:07,790
I fought hard

109
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:09,910
to get Tie Zhu a chance to participate.

110
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:14,310
If Tie Zhu joins an Immortal sect,

111
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:17,430
those guys won't dare to bully you again.

112
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:24,670
Immortal cultivation sounds great,

113
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:27,390
but I have heard it's an incredibly dangerous path.

114
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:30,390
We will make more carvings this year

115
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:33,910
so he can focus on next year's imperial exam.

116
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:38,110
As for the debts, even if it takes decades,

117
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:40,350
I will pay them back.

118
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:43,150
Even if it takes 20 years,

119
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:45,070
I accept it.

120
00:08:57,400 --> 00:08:58,070
Father,

121
00:08:58,800 --> 00:08:59,630
Mother,

122
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:03,230
I've never slacked off all these years

123
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:05,350
but our family still suffers.

124
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:07,710
I won't let you be oppressed anymore.

125
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:09,590
I won't let you work so hard.

126
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,430
I've made up my mind.

127
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:12,870
If life is already hard,

128
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,470
I might as well risk it all.

129
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:17,310
Our fate isn't set by the heavens !

130
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,590
Tie Zhu...

131
00:09:20,920 --> 00:09:22,030
Brother, Sister,

132
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:23,950
at least let Tie Zhu try.

133
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:30,110
Father, Mother,

134
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:31,710
Fourth Uncle...

135
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:34,350
Tie Zhu won’t disappoint you.

136
00:09:35,520 --> 00:09:37,870
Since I’ve chosen the hardest path,

137
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,950
I’ll give it my all !

138
00:09:50,400 --> 00:09:53,310
Back then, when we were kicked out of the village,

139
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:56,070
I never thought we’d return one day.

140
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:58,910
Tie Zhu,

141
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:03,910
don’t take their harsh words to heart.

142
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:06,310
Father, don’t worry.

143
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:09,160
Wang Family Ancestral Hall

144
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:08,040
Wang Family Ancestral Hall\NWang Family Village

145
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:13,790
Oh,

146
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:15,430
it's Second Brother and Tie Zhu.

147
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:17,470
Please forgive us for earlier.

148
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:25,430
Tie Zhu has come !

149
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:28,390
Tie Zhu has been clever since childhood.

150
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:29,110
Exactly !

151
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:32,200
Wang Hao\NWang Lin's cousin

152
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:32,160
Brother Tie Zhu, you’re here !

153
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:32,870
Yes.

154
00:10:35,040 --> 00:10:36,430
The Immortals take disciples

155
00:10:36,680 --> 00:10:38,270
