156
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:42,040
Wang Zhuo\NWang Lin's cousin

157
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:41,320
Do you think that carving wood Immortals

158
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:43,320
will help you absorb spiritual energy ?

159
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:46,640
I have heard

160
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:50,350
that Immortal Xu of the Heng Yue Sect took a liking to Wang Zhuo.

161
00:10:50,760 --> 00:10:53,270
That’s why our Wang Family got 3 spots.

162
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,440
Is that an Immortal !?

163
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:05,120
It really is an Immortal !

164
00:11:05,640 --> 00:11:07,340
The Immortal has come !

165
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:15,310
Greetings Immortal !

166
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:21,360
So this is an Immortal ?

167
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:24,830
Are you three

168
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:25,710
the candidates ?

169
00:11:24,040 --> 00:11:26,280
Zhang Kuang\NHeng Yue Sect disciple\N8th layer of Qi Condensation

170
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:27,990
Greetings Immortal,

171
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:29,350
these are the three.

172
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:32,470
Are you Wang Zhuo ?

173
00:11:33,560 --> 00:11:35,320
You are a fine young man.

174
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:37,270
No wonder Uncle Daoxu took a liking to you.

175
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:40,320
You flatter me, Senior Brother.

176
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:42,360
I am Wang Lin.

177
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:43,480
I am Wang Hao.

178
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:50,990
Hop on.

179
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:54,680
Immortal,

180
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:56,910
allow me to bid farewell to my parents.

181
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:14,550
Father,

182
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:15,910
Mother,

183
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:18,520
your son will do his best.

184
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:21,150
Please take care of yourselves.

185
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:28,630
My son, it doesn't matter if you are not chosen.

186
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:32,670
You can always come back, we will always be there for you.

187
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:35,190
Mother, don’t worry.

188
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:53,920
Country bumpkins...

189
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:55,640
Brother Tie Zhu, don’t worry,

190
00:12:55,640 --> 00:12:58,040
I’ll look out for you at the Heng Yue Sect.

191
00:12:59,880 --> 00:13:00,720
Okay,

192
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:02,160
I’ll count on you then.

193
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:02,800
Heng Yue Sect\NCountry of Zhao

194
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:37,550
Wow...

195
00:13:38,400 --> 00:13:39,920
Is this an Immortal sect ?

196
00:13:56,040 --> 00:13:58,720
Immortal Platform\NHeng Yue Sect

197
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:01,950
Why is the fog so thick ?

198
00:14:02,560 --> 00:14:03,550
Immortal sects

199
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:04,760
really are mysterious.

200
00:14:04,960 --> 00:14:05,960
Ignorants.

201
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:07,880
This is the Fog Concealment Formation,

202
00:14:07,880 --> 00:14:10,640
did you think mortals can just stumble upon the sect ?

203
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:27,440
Huanglong Zhenren\NHeng Yue Sect Leader\NPeak Late stage Foundation Establishment

204
00:14:24,520 --> 00:14:27,590
I am Huanglong Zhenren,

205
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:29,990
the Heng Yue Sect Leader.

206
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:33,950
The Heng Yue Sect’s disciple selection has always been strict.

207
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:35,280
Among all of you,

208
00:14:35,280 --> 00:14:37,790
only a few will be chosen

209
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:40,110
to be Heng Yue Sect disciples.

210
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:45,440
Talent is primordial for cultivation.

211
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:48,030
The first test is: Spirit Roots

212
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:48,640
Sun Dazhu\NHeng Yue Sect Elder\NEarly stage Foundation Establishment

213
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:48,640
Daoxu Zhenren\NHeng Yue Sect Elder\NEarly stage Foundation Establishment

214
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:03,110
Not qualified.

215
00:15:05,360 --> 00:15:06,830
Not qualified.

216
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:10,030
Not qualified.

217
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:13,390
Not qualified.

218
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:24,360
You must be Wang Zhuo, whom Junior Brother Daoxu mentioned.

219
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:26,160
You indeed have some talent.

220
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:27,350
Stand to the right.

221
00:15:28,800 --> 00:15:30,040
Not qualified.

222
00:15:33,040 --> 00:15:34,350
Not qualified.

223
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:36,630
Look at this guy.

224
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:39,000
It'll soon be my turn...

225
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:42,990
Immortal, I bless you to live a long life.

226
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:46,080
Your humble servant Wang Hao kowtows to you.

227
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:53,550
You might be clever

228
00:15:53,680 --> 00:15:54,790
but your talent is...

229
00:15:54,800 --> 00:15:55,760
Immortal,

230
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:58,910
this is a 300 years old spirit herb my father found in the mountains.

231
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:01,070
I brought it specially for you

232
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:02,550
as a gift.

233
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:08,600
It happens that I'm in need of a helper for alchemy.

234
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:11,080
Are you willing to be my helper ?

235
00:16:11,640 --> 00:16:12,760
Disciple is willing !

236
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:16,150
You can do this ?!

237
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:19,870
Not qualified.

238
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:21,670
Not qualified.

239
00:16:33,640 --> 00:16:34,870
Not qualified.

240
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:39,950
If you can't even repay your family, then what future do you have ?

241
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:43,350
You can take whatever you want from us, but this money is my son's future !

242
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:44,920
Do you think that carving wood Immortals

243
00:16:44,920 --> 00:16:46,110
will help you absorb spiritual energy ?

244
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:47,160
The first test is:

245
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:48,350
Spirit Roots

246
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:51,310
No, it's not over yet.

247
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:53,800
This Zhenren guy said this is was only the first test.

248
00:16:54,080 --> 00:16:54,850
It means

249
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:56,350
there must be others tests.

250
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:59,790
Spirit Roots are important for cultivation

251
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:04,910
but those with enough perseverance

252
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:07,430
may also become sect disciples.

253
00:17:08,760 --> 00:17:11,310
Whether you can join the Heng Yue Sect

254
00:17:11,320 --> 00:17:14,710
will depend on whether you can climb these steps.

255
00:17:15,040 --> 00:17:18,320
Heavenly Steps\NHeng Yue Sect

256
00:17:15,600 --> 00:17:20,270
If you can reach the summit before the sunset.

257
00:17:20,280 --> 00:17:21,470
then you will pass.

258
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:24,960
If you can't, then you will fail.

259
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:28,590
If you feel like you can't endure it anymore,

260
00:17:28,600 --> 00:17:30,510
then shout “I give up”

261
00:17:31,120 --> 00:17:33,950
and someone will retrieve you.

262
00:17:37,280 --> 00:17:38,030
I was first !

263
00:17:38,040 --> 00:17:38,870
Stop pushing me !

264
00:17:40,560 --> 00:17:41,270
Get out of my way !

265
00:17:41,280 --> 00:17:42,230
Why are you pushing ?!

266
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:44,830
This is my last chance.

267
00:17:56,520 --> 00:17:57,270
Move !

268
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:20,190
