270
00:18:21,320 --> 00:18:22,750
I give up !

271
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:24,470
I’m burning !

272
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:26,590
I give up !

273
00:18:26,600 --> 00:18:27,470
Eliminated.

274
00:18:33,120 --> 00:18:34,270
I can’t hold on !

275
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:36,110
Eliminated.

276
00:18:40,120 --> 00:18:41,190
I give up !

